    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15552" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρρωστ-ία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>weakness, sickness,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>VM</u>
				6
			</span></i>, etc.: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1115a2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				731.7
			</span></i> (Tomi, <span class="entity">i B. C.</span>): esp. <i>lingering ailment,
				bad state of health,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Phryn.
				<u>PS</u>
				p.10
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τοῦ ἀδικεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					359b
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>moral weakness,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
				<u>Prooem.</u>
				53
			</span></i>; <i>loss of morale,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				7.47
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τις διανοίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					253a33
				</span></i>
			: c. gen., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τοῦ στρατεύειν</span>
			<i>lack of eagerness</i> to serve, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.15
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phryn.
				<u>PS</u>
				p.10
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i></div>
